Data and marks not covered by the MIT License

- data/dem/*, examples/viewer/data/oroville-* and examples/viewer/data/teton-*:
  derived from the USGS 3D Elevation Program (3DEP), a U.S. Government work in the
  public domain.
- examples/viewer/data/grandisle-bed.f32: derived from NOAA NCEI Continuously
  Updated Digital Elevation Model (CUDEM) tiles (doi:10.25921/ds9v-ky35), public
  domain.
- examples/viewer/data/grandisle-solid.u8 and grandisle-shape.i8: derived from
  OpenStreetMap data, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, and available under the Open
  Database License 1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/); see
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright.
- examples/viewer/data/monai-bed.f32 and monai.json: derived from NTHMP benchmark
  problem 7 (https://github.com/rjleveque/nthmp-benchmark-problems), a laboratory
  model of the Monai Valley coast (Central Research Institute of Electric Power
  Industry; Liu, Yeh and Synolakis, 2008).
- examples/viewer/logo_hilab.png and the HydroInformatics Lab name are not
  licensed under the MIT License; all rights reserved.
